Read docs/BRAND.md before any visual, copy, or naming change.

The public mark is the Cherub. Never use Cherubim as a mark, a line, or a product name.
Say House of Junaid. Never Royal.
The Cherubim and Seraphim church, its founders, and Holy Michael stay on /about only.
No sacred text and no Cherub on a floor piece or anything worn below the waist.
No celebrity likeness and no third-party mark on saleable work.
